---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Joseph Juneau | Perfect Sync Press" description="Author bio for Joseph Juneau, writer of Perfectly in Sync.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Author</p>
      <h1>Joseph Juneau</h1>
      <p class="lede">A writer living, finally, deliberately, and on his own terms.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container two-col">
      <div>
        <h2>About the author</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose book-description">
        <p>Joseph Juneau spent a good portion of his life letting life have the wheel.</p>

        <p>It turns out life is a confident driver with strong opinions and absolutely no interest in your input. For a long time, that was fine. You adapt, you show up, you do what's in front of you. Life gets lived, just not always on your terms.</p>

        <p>At some point, that changes. It has to.</p>

        <p>Writing became the place where Joseph finally gets to set the agenda. When you stop letting life narrate itself and start doing it yourself, something opens up. The experiences, the observations, the stories that quietly stacked up over the years have somewhere to go now.</p>

        <p>He writes with honesty, warmth, and a genuine appreciation for the fact that it's never too late to grab the wheel back.</p>

        <p>Joseph Juneau is a writer living, finally, deliberately, and on his own terms.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/book/">Read About Perfectly in Sync</a>
          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
